# Host build output and dependencies must never reach the build context: the
# native ones (argon2, Prisma engines) are built for the host platform and
# would overwrite what `pnpm install` produces inside the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

vault
docs
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
